window.products.push({"id":526031,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Amuse Bouche Ypsilon After Dinner Glass, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619TM2aoPBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honoured craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. The latest trend in international cuisine is to go beyond the bounds of qualitative taste gratification and to also \"amuse the palate\" with offerings that are becoming increasingly innovative and aesthectically creative, especially in terms of the ways they are presented and consumed. Here's how Bormioli Rocco rises to the challenge of this trend, with no less than 9 extremely versatile small-format gift-packaged products that come with a multilingual recipe sheet offering 6 highly original sweet and savoury recipes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619TM2aoPBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B002IT6WVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002IT6WVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002IT6WVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526032,"name":"Harry Potter Style with names Laser Engraved Custom 9x12 Bamboo Cutting Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLN54shWL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cutting board for a unique Wedding, Christmas, Birthday, Housewarming, or just any day, to remember their day in kitchen. This is a laser engraved bamboo cutting board. As with any wood laser engraving on wood will create various texture and give it a very unique style. Cutting board size is 12x9 Engraving is free for existing designs. If you would like a custom order, please convo me. There will be additional charges for custom orders due to the amount of time and detail we take to get your order right. Keep watching the site for different designs, products, board sets, and promotions! My boards are 100% recycled bamboo, engraved by myself. Bamboo is a renewable resource which helps protect our precious forests, absorb greenhouse gases, and every part of the plant can be utilized after harvest. Many species grow more than three feet each day!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SLN54shWL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chrisses Crosses Cake Toppers and More Laser Cutting and Engraving","source_asin":"B0763C3WKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0763C3WKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0763C3WKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526033,"name":"JIANLEJIA50Pcs Rose Gold Balloons & Gold & Champagne Gold, Color Latex Party Balloons for Baby Shower, Gender Reveal, Wedding, Hawaii, Bachelorette Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whSFTdasL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your party will be the talk of the town! Thinking hard of on-trend backdrops that will surely be a remarkable one? Do you want to add a modern touch to your special occasion that creates a show-stopping scene? Rose Gold is a top trending stunning color to add some glamour to your celebration. Use these gorgeous, extravagant rose gold party decorations to easily enhance the décor of your wedding proposal, engagement party, sweet 16, baby shower, bridal shower, birthday, bachelorette party, anniversary and much more! High-quality latex, Non-toxicity and harmlessness, balloons are strong and long-lasting, and you won't have to worry about them tearing or bursting when inflated. Perfect party decorations and supplies for adding a romantic and festive atmosphere to a special day! Inflate with air or 100% helium, and rub balloons on a carpet or other static surface to get confetti to stick to the sides. Let these balloons float to the ceiling, tie them with tasselled string for extra flair, or bunch them together to create an eye-catching balloon bouquet or table centerpiece. It would make the party outstanding, attractive, and more fun to everybody; you can make any design or style of decoration with these latex balloons. Use A1BLU party balloons as an accent to any party theme or color scheme. These rose gold themed balloons are sure to shine! The spectacular blend of favorite pack of 50 Gold & Rose Gold & Champagne Gold color latex graduation party balloons is an amazing thing to see.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51whSFTdasL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A1BLU","source_asin":"B07D8HKMGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8HKMGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8HKMGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526034,"name":"Cacala Pure Series 3-in-1 Peshtemal Turkish Bath Towel, Backpack & Poncho – Convertible Backpack 100% Cotton Beach Towel - Absorbent, Soft & Quick Dry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vmuQF9dxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMFORTABLE & DURABLE: Made from 100% Cotton, CACALA Convertible Turkish Bath Towels are lightweight and durable while providing unmatched softness and absorbency. Turkish cotton towels are more absorbent than ordinary towels making these the perfect choice for any parent that wants to make sure their children have a wonderful time at the beach. 3-IN-1 BATH TOWEL: Soft, lightweight and versatile, our 3-in-1 Peshtemal Turkish Bath Towel is made to provide you with a simple way to make beach travels easier than ever before. Our Turkish beach towel can seamlessly be converted between a backpack, full body covering poncho and a large Turkish towel which means that you’ll never have to worry about the fuss of packing for your little ones trip to the beach. QUICK DRYING & HIGHLY ABSORBENT: Thanks to highly absorbent properties of Turkish Cotton, our Convertible Backpack 100% Cotton Beach Towel uses natural fibers to absorb water faster as well as quick to dry preventing it from building mold and mildew. With its large size, it can easily cover your child ’s entire body to dry them fast and can be worn as a poncho to keep them comfy while helping them stay dry. COMPACT & VERSATILE: Lightweight and compact, this travel beach towel is exactly what you need to travel smart. This Peshtemal Turkish towel seamlessly changes between a Full Sized Bath Towel, A Backpack For Convenient Storage & Poncho in a few easy steps making it the most versatile and reliable Quick Drying Travel Towel For Kids on the market. QUALITY YOU CAN TRUST: At CACALA, our customers have always been and always will be our top priority. This is why we go the extra mile and acquire the finest materials to ensure our customers are getting the best Turkish Bath Towel on the market. We’re so confident that you’ll love our convertible bath towel that we offer a 30-DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE so that you know you’re making a Risk Free Investment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vmuQF9dxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cacala","source_asin":"B077ZJCNK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077ZJCNK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077ZJCNK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
