window.products.push({"id":526040,"name":"Oyydecor Coat Hooks Wall Mounted, Bamboo Black Coat Rack with 4 Hooks, Heavy Duty Decorative Wall Hooks for Hanging Bag, Robes, Jacket, Clothes, Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bjch9x8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[UNIQUE DESIGN] The coat hooks feature an upward curved hook, ensuring both aesthetics and preventing items from easily falling off. It adds a touch of brightness to your home decor. [AMPLE HANGING SPACE] The coat hooks wall mounted have four hooks, providing ample hanging space for your coats, hats, keys, scarves, towels, and keeping them tidy and organized, eliminating the frustration of searching for these items. [WIDE APPLICATIONS] You can use wall hooks for hanging various items such as bags, umbrellas, jackets, dog leashes, hats, bags, towels, keys, and more. The coat rack can be installed in the living room, kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, entrance, and other areas. [PREMIUM MATERIALS] The hooks for hanging coats are made of natural bamboo wood, and the hooks are made of matte black polished aluminum alloy, with a smooth surface and comfortable touch, ensuring it won't damage the clothes hanging on them. It is waterproof, anti-corrosion, anti-cracking, durable, and timeless. [EASY INSTALLATION] This wall hook comes with installation hardware and step-by-step instructions, making installation quick and simple, allowing you to immediately enjoy the convenience of this wall-mounted hook installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Bjch9x8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oyydecor","source_asin":"B0C61YJT7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C61YJT7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C61YJT7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
