window.products.push({"id":526058,"name":"Convenience Concepts Royal Crest 2 Tier Acrylic Glass End Table, Rose Gold/Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CKrG2yiJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your living space to luxury and glam with the Royal Crest 2 Tier Acrylic Glass End Table by Convenience Concepts. Featuring four acrylic legs that support two rose gold chrome metal frames and two tiers of clear tempered glass shelves. Great for entertaining, the spacious tabletop gives you and your guests plenty of table space to place beverages and more. Additional space is available on the 2nd tier of this extravagant end table to showcase your glamourous decorative items. This classy end table is quick to assemble with only 3 easy steps required. Shop coordinating pieces from the complete Royal Crest Collection by Convenience Concepts, each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CKrG2yiJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Convenience Concepts","source_asin":"B0C43P6H9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C43P6H9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C43P6H9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526059,"name":"Special XL Size Long Back Jacquard Stretch Dining Chair slipcovers - Spandex Plush Short Chair Covers Solid Large Dining Room Chair Protector Home Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VPLqekEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KELUINA is ourself brand,the versatile dining chair covers will give your chair a new look!Our chair covers use prime quality fabric, it is not only highly elastic to fit the majority chairs, but also thick enough to protect chairs again dust, stains and other damages.Moreover, we have a fabulous selection of colors for you. You can choose the colors according to the decoration style of your home.You may not wash your chair, but you can wash its cover! It’s easy to keep it clean by machine washing in cold.Dust, stains and other dirt trapped in the cover can be easily washed away. This helps provide a cleaner environment for you.Care InstructionsRecommended Washing Instructions:Machine Washable, Wash Below 86°F (30°C).Gentle cycle, do not bleach.Tumble dry low.Iron,steam or dry, with LOW HEATPackage included: 2 x Large chair coversWarranty: 180 days.ATTENTION:1.please check the size for your chair before order and it is not fit with arm chair. 2. Because the light, computer screen resolution is different individually when customer looking at the items, the colors showed in screen may different from the actual items. Because the product batches are different, please pay attention to the color difference when purchasing the product. If you buy set of 6 chair covers, you need buy 3 pack(set of 2) .  If you are not sure about the color or others, please connect us, and we will assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VPLqekEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KELUINA","source_asin":"B07V6RFVFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V6RFVFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V6RFVFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526060,"name":"COOKINA Silicone Reusable Baking Mat 100% Non-Stick, Easy to Clean Cooking Sheet for Gas, Electric, Toaster and Convection Ovens, 16.5 x11-inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3mGam87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Included in the package: 1 reusable COOKINA Silicone Baking Mat 1 storage COOKINA Ring Design* 1 scouring pad /ul COOKINA’s baking mats are 100% non-stick, eliminating the need for butter, oils or cooking sprays that add extra calories, all while keeping your food tender, juicy and tasty! It’s also ideal to achieve wonderful pastries and bakeries. COOKINA’s cooking mats are easy to clean up and literally eliminate the need to scrub your baking pans, so you can enjoy oven cooking without the mess! Simply wipe clean in warm soapy water after each use. Even better, it is dishwasher safe! COOKINA’s silicone mat will save you time, money and will help you care for the environment! Our baking mats are reusable and are a clever and convenient alternative to costly single-use products like aluminum, parchment and wax papers. Be smart, reduce waste! The authentic design allows you to bake all kinds of food, from meats to vegetables and pastries to bakeries. It is specially formulated for high-temperature cooking which can reach up to 464°F (240°C), while still being safe and effective. We take great pride in our products and hope you love them as much as we do. Every COOKINA product comes with a security seal. Peel it off to find your unique registration code to authenticate your COOKINA and become an AKADEMIA! member. In order to get the most out of this product and prolong its life, we recommend not using metal utensils. Do not put your COOKINA into the oven while the self-cleaning is on. *COOKINA, PARCHMINUM, COOKINA PAKS, the COOKINA Ring Design and the three-dimensional ring and opening on the packaging are all trademarks of COOKINA Holdings Inc. used under licensed by COOKINA Inc. stains, discoloration and scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3mGam87L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOKINA","source_asin":"B0864XPNT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0864XPNT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0864XPNT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526061,"name":"Pimpernel Beach Prize Collection Coasters | Set of 6 | Cork Backed Board | Heat and Stain Resistant | Drinks Coaster for Tabletop Protection | Measure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TOztg-i3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"INCREDIBLE ARTISTRY: Make every day a vacation with the Beach Prize Collection from Pimpernel. Features beautiful seashells sitting on the shoreline, the soft colors with the incredible details make this design a huge hit everyone. Bring a little bit of paradise into your home. STRONG AND STYLISH: Our quality placemats and coasters use a 5mm board topped with a unique and exclusive art print. Each is totally sealed with a high-quality coating that is both stain and heat resistant to 212 degrees Celsius. The placemats and coasters are then finished with a hard-wearing cork back that protects precious furniture. SOMETHING FOR EVERYONE: Pimpernel is the premier brand for placemats, coasters, trays, and accessories, with an outstanding and unique range that is renowned for its high quality. Pimpernel's exclusive homewares, textiles and gifts are created to suit all tastes, and make wonderful additions to the home. TIMELESS DESIGNS: Portmeirion was founded by legendary ceramic designer Susan William-Ellis in 1960 and has remained at the forefront of contemporary design ever since. Renowned for our tableware and giftware, Portmeirion produces beautiful and unique collections all of which are made to the highest standard to be enjoyed every day. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Pimpernel Beach Prize Collection Coasters - Set of 6. Made of Cork-Backed Board. Each Coaster measures 4 inches x 4 inches. Product Care: Clean with a damp sponge and dry with a soft cloth. Do not immerse in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TOztg-i3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pimpernel","source_asin":"B01IPA9QPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IPA9QPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IPA9QPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526062,"name":"Copco Wedge Organizer for Lazy Susan, 10.8 x 16.7 x 4 Inch, White and Charcoal Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DUmKNdgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your home with the Copco Wedge Organizer. The 4 individual wedges form a circle with 4 equal sections surrounding a 3.5 inch space in the center. This organizer provides easy access to items in lazy Susans, cabinets, and fridges, on counters, or under sinks. Use to store dry food and pantry items, cleaning supplies, personal care products, and more. The outer wall prevents items from falling off, while the nonslip liner keeps items securely in place. Use the built-in handle to easily transport wedges around your home. Wedges can be used together or separately. Simply wipe clean with a damp cloth. Measures 10.8 x 16.7 x 4 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DUmKNdgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copco","source_asin":"B09SJ35WZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SJ35WZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SJ35WZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526063,"name":"ArtToFrames Collage Photo Frame Double Mat with 9 - 8x10 Openings and Satin Black Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tyk8NhSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your one-of-a-kind photos deserve one-of-a-kind frames, but visiting a custom frame shop can be time consuming and expensive. ArtToFrames extensive and growing line of inexpensive multi opening Photo Mats will get you the look you want at a price you can afford. Our Photo Mats come in a variety of sizes and colors and can be custom made to your needs. Frame choices range from traditional to contemporary, with both single and multiple photo opening mat options. With our large selection of custom frame and mat choices, the design possibilities are limitless. When you're done, you'll have a unique custom framed photo that will look like you spent a fortune at a frame shop. Your frame will be delivered directly to your front door or sent as a gift straight to your recipient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Tyk8NhSFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtToFrames","source_asin":"B018OYZO6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018OYZO6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018OYZO6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
