window.products.push({"id":526099,"name":"My Triple Peeler | Most Versatile 3 in 1 Rotary Peeler with Standard Blade, Soft Skin Blade, Julienne Blade, Potato Eye Remover | Extra Durable ABS an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M9CdQ69vL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"My Triple Peeler (TM) Is your kitchen full of gadgets for this and for that? Constantly wishing for kitchen tools that are multifunctional?  It’s about time that someone heard your requests. We came up with My Triple Peeler (TM), a 3-in-1 rotary peeler in one compact item. It has standard blade, soft skin blade, and Julienne blade. Literally 3 blades in your fingertips! Changing the blades can be done in a snap by turning the silver knob in the middle. We also feature a loop to remove potato eyes. The blades are super sharp, and the non-slip round body supports either left or right handed. From peeling to digging out bad spots in fruits or veggies, this versatile tool does it all so effortlessly. You can make the cutest julienned carrots and perfect slices of zucchini in no time. Your scalloped potatoes will be the hit of the party. No more finger cramps when you make those apple pies for Thanksgiving. What a lifesaver!  We choose anti-rust stainless blades and premium ABS to craft this kitchen gadget. Not only sturdy and well-constructed, My Triple Peeler (TM) can be taken apart easily for effortless cleanup in warm soapy water or the dishwasher. It is only 2.5” in diameter, so storing it is a breeze. Put it in the drawer, hang it on the counter, or stick it in your bag when you go camping or traveling. Moreover, the bright green color will look super cute in any kitchen.  This highly functional and attractive peeler is just an essential you should have in the kitchen, and definitely makes for the perfect gift. Grab yours today! (c) My Triple Peeler (TM) Related Searches: 3 in 1 vegetable peeler, 3 in 1 peeler, 3 in 1 peeler grater slicer, rotary kitchen peeler, 3 blade rotary peeler, rotary peeler, rotary fruit peeler, rotary apple peeler, julienne peeler","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M9CdQ69vL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peelers","source_asin":"B01051DYL0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01051DYL0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01051DYL0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
