window.products.push({"id":526105,"name":"Handheld Steam Cleaner, Steamer for Cleaning, with Steam Lock Button for Hands-free Steaming, Continuous Steam with Limitless Use Time, 120℃ Pressuriz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714tTh1BPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【20s Fast Heating with Continuous Steam】 Just aim the steamer at the stain, then turn on the switches and wait for about 15-20 seconds. The steamer will spray super strong pressured steam up to 120℃(temp at the nozzle), instead of a long 4-min wait for heating. Further more, EAVE steam cleaner keeps heating while using to maintain its heat and keep the steam strong and continuous, which is different from all other designs that need a break every 2 minutes to reheat and rebuild the pressure. 【Limitless Use Time - Add Water Anytime】 Add water anytime during use to make it last infinitely. The maxi load 270ml steams out for 10mins w/o intervals, and a refill of 270ml extends its use to another 10mins w/o having you wait: let it cool down, struggle with opening lid, fill water and wait it to reheat. 2 water level visible windows let you know tank is full when filling and time to refill during use w/o guesswork. The auto shut off avoids running dry in the event of a lack of water. 【Steam Lock Button for Hands-free Using】 The global patent design with improvements in every way makes this EAVE high-tech handheld steam cleaner a win that outperforms all other models. The unique steam lock button frees your hands so you don’t have to hold onto the trigger the whole time while steam cleaning, no more continuous hand pressure. EAVE steam cleaner, weighs less(1.2kg only) for reduced hand fatigue, but holds quite more(270ml) for less refills. 【120℃/248℉ High Temp Pressured Steam】 The steam this handheld steam cleaner produces is very hot up to 120℃(temp at the nozzle) as well as sufficient(equivalent to the wind at 70m/s acts on 0.155 per square inch), which are the results you’ve never seen on other models that are not hot enough and no sufficient steam volume and pressure to actually work on anythings. Bear in mind that it is the most powerful one that takes less elbow grease and less clean up time. 【Nano Fine Steam & No Droplets In Any Angle】 Eave handheld steamer for cleaning comes with full accessories kit for multi-surface/material domestic cleaning: Grout(The super sturdy metal brush works wonders), kitchen stove, window, glass and bathroom mirrors, tile, as well as kids’ toys and pets’ mattresses. The well sealed tank has no chance to leak in any angle you position the handheld steam cleaner, and the self-cleaning function(descale) makes it last. (Select the correct mode before use!)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714tTh1BPoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eave","source_asin":"B0C5RKYFH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5RKYFH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5RKYFH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
