window.products.push({"id":526240,"name":"Halter Wall Mounted Floating Shelves, Rustic Bookshelves for Bedroom Décor, Floating Wall Shelves for Living Room Bedroom Kitchen Bathroom Hanging She","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gHmMxPJTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Get organized in style! Searching for that perfect item to provide you with a little bit of extra storage? Need something to help you add decorative touches to your room? Have some plants that need a home or book collection that is spilling over? Only have a small space to work with? Look no further, Halter has the answer! Our high quality floating wall shelves with prism brackets are the perfect solution to your storage needs. *Minimalist Design: This small and rustic wall shelf set is made in a classic, streamlined design for optimal functionality. With its simple look, this wall shelf set can be integrated into almost any decor. It's a perfect piece of functional furniture. *Versatile: These wooden wall shelves can be used as almost anything: -Bedroom wall shelves -Bathroom wall shelves -Kitchen wall shelves (spice rack) -Office wall shelves -Wall shelves for plants -Bookshelves -Display shelves And much more! *Strong and Sturdy: This set of floating wall shelves is made with high quality wood that can hold your books, spices, plants and treasured items without wobbling, breaking or cracking. The prism metal brackets secure them to the wall and ensure everything is anchored well. Each bracket was made with style and functionality in mind. *Easy Installation: With all the tools you need for construction included, setting up this hanging wall shelf set easy and painless. They can be up and supporting your items in just a couple of simple steps. These levitating shelves can also be mixed and matched for uses in different rooms. Use one as a laundry room shelf and use the other two as shelves for wall decor. Mount two as kitchen racks and the remaining one can go towards holding your potted plants. These are the ultimate floating shelves for your wall!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gHmMxPJTL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Halter","source_asin":"B0BV2MMFCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV2MMFCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV2MMFCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526241,"name":"Growsun Coffee Bar Shelf with Hooks & Basket Wall Mounted Shelves with Hooks and Baskets Storage for Entryway, Kitchen, Living Room, Bathroom, 3 Baske","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuNPLIYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Made of solid wood for base frame and metal for the basket and hanging rod. Sturdy enough for heavy display and winter coat. Wide Application: Our wall mounted shelf suitable for entryway, kitchen, living room and bathroom. Multifunctional: You can display the decor on the top and storage your small things into the basket, such as keys,towel or spice jar, and you can hanging your coat, coffee mug and etc. with the hooks. Easy to Assembly: You just to need drill 2 holes on the wall, and put the anchors and screw. PS: the level tools will help to make easy to find the point for drilling. Package Include: Main shelf, A spirit level, A couple anchors and screw, Free ‘HOME’ decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BuNPLIYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Growsun","source_asin":"B094XWTXR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094XWTXR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094XWTXR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526242,"name":"BEWQ Glass Canning Jars Sealed Container Vacuum Fresh Keeper Airtight Canister with Leakproof Rubber Gasket for Food Storage with Black Shield 42 OZ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+lILY+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The New Vacuum Technology: Press the evacuated air, so that the low pressure and low oxygen environment in the coffee containers, delay oxidation, can be extended several times longer than the preservation of the ordinary vacuum sealed jars. Press gas pumping, easy a few steps, simple operation: the common preservation tank on the market, complex operation, inconvenient operation, preservation ability is too poor. Keep Food Fresh: Cookie jars for kitchen counter looks beautiful in any setting. Gorgeous on a candy buffet, set on table, office desk, countertop, in your pantry, or any other easily accessible spot for a convenient self-serve option. Glass canning jars comes with an airtight lid and a rubber gasket, enabling you to keep it on display with a light heart. Sealring Upgrade Version: Keep your coffee or snacks untained in Atmosphere, a beautifully functional and fully sealable food jar with a powerful silicone ring that stops air, moisture, odors, and other funk from seeping in ; When left unopened Atmos' seal will keep air out for around a week in-between brews. Reverse does not leak, seal well, upgrade the sealant ring, the vacuum effect is not dripping. Patented Airtight Pop Up Set: Push the button on the lid is pressed for an airtight seal, pop the button back up to lift the lid. The silicone sealed ring acts as a seal keeping its contents fresh. Keep your coffee beans fresher, longer, extend the shelf life of your coffee. Exceptional Durability: Borosilicate glass is very durable against temperature changes, making it a perfect choice for preserving your coffee grounds. Our airtight coffee canister is built to last. In the meantime, the glass coffee containers also come with the black shield used for coffee storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+lILY+TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEWQ","source_asin":"B099J4VSJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099J4VSJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099J4VSJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
