window.products.push({"id":526264,"name":"Maxwelly Striped Sofa Slipcover Sofa Cover Furniture Protector Anti-Slip Couch Shield Elastic Straps Pets Kids Children Dog Cat(Sofa, Red/Blue/White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A-OYtj-AL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Maxwelly Sofa Cover protects your furniture from pet hair and stains. It saves you from the hassles of everyday life. Below are a list of common questions: What size should I order ? We HIGHLY RECOMMEND measuring before ordering as every piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be happy with the fit. You can find a detailed measuring guide in the photos or measure the seat width as follows: Sofa extra-wide: seat width up to 78\" Futon: seat width up to 70\" Sofa: seat width up to 68\" Love seat: seat width up to 54\" Chair and a half: seat width up to 48\" Loveseat small: seat width up to 46\"  Oversized recliner: seat width up to 30\" Chair: seat width up to 21\" Q & A: 1. Is this recommended for fabric covered furniture? Yes, it is perfect for fabric covered furniture. Ordering the right size and having fabric furniture will result in a good fit and a cover that stays in place. THIS IS NOT RECOMMENDED FOR LEATHER. Leather is slippery and the cover will not stay in place even with the adjustable strap. 2. Will it protect my furniture? Yes, it will protect your furniture from hair and dirt. While it will help a little with liquids, this is not water proof. This is intentional as a waterproof cover will just result in the liquids rolling onto the floor. 3. Can I put this in the washing machine? Of course. This is machine washable and dryer safe. Directions are included with the cover. 4. If I order it and it does't fit, can I return it? Absolutely. We want you to be happy. If you are not happy for any reason (even after Amazon return window), please reach out to us directly for a full refund. If you are looking for great and cost-effective way of re-inventing the function and protect your sofa, this is the way!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A-OYtj-AL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxwelly","source_asin":"B07TFSBX17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TFSBX17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TFSBX17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
