window.products.push({"id":526306,"name":"imarku Iron Wok, 12\" No Coated Hammered Frying Pan, Rust Proof Carbon Steel Frying Pan Skillet, Flat Bottom Wok with Chinese Traditional Craft - Wok P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xr-PizzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🫕【Historical Forging Process】Zhangqiu is the \"hometown of blacksmiths\", and imarku's iron wok was made by experienced Zhangqiu blacksmiths using the hammered techniques handed down from the Spring and Autumn Period. The production of the Zhangqiu iron pot requires 12 processes, 18 times of fire, high-temperature tempering of about 1,000 degrees, and 10,000 times of forging. Through the perfect fusion of multiple craftsmanships and blacksmith spirit, imarku cookware would be even better! 🥩【Authentic Forged Frying Pan】imarku iron wok pan goes through exemplary craftsmanship processes by a blacksmith, forging a unique hammer pattern, forming a slightly convex fish scale-like surface to prevent sticking to the frying pan, and stir-fries with ease. Also, a flat bottom wok has a wide bottom, it conducts heat faster than coated nonstick wok so that it can lock the juice and nutrition inside the food. Since it is a flat bottom pan, suitable for almost all stoves. 🍖【Non-coating & Sticking-proof】The surface of the Chinese wok is smooth without chemical coating. Say goodbye to those coated wok pan, the uncoated iron wok can be safer to touch the ingredients, giving you a healthier cooking experience. Carbon steel pan will form a protective film during cooking and will become less sticky the longer they are used. Based seasoning and maintenance, help to cook more delicious dishes with less oil. 🍳【Cleanand & Maintenance】 imarku iron pan has oil adsorption during the daily cooking process to make the surface smoother, you only need to wash it with hot water and wipe it dry. A wok pan is not stable at the beginning, it is recommended to wash it by hand with hot water in time after use, and apply a thin layer of oil after drying to prevent rust. Tip: The carbon steel pan is coated with a layer of non-stick oil film when it is unpacked (normal for the dust to adhere). 🥘【Ergonomic Handle】The handle of the carbon steel wok is connected by triple rivets, just install it according to the instructions. A removable iron pot handle can keep cool when cooking at a high temperature, also can remove the handle and put the frying pan in the oven for use. The ergonomic handle design ensures a comfortable grip, and the hanging ring on the handle is designed for hanging storage for drying easily and saving kitchen space. 🥗【Perfect Size and Weight】The capacity of the 12-inch carbon steel pan can meet the cooking expectations of 3~5 people. 2MM thickened pot body has better thermal insulation and energy saving. The weight of 2KG is much lighter than the cast iron pan, with the help of the anti-scalding handle, the ladies can move the frying pan easily. It's also the perfect gift for weddings, Valentine's Day, housewarmings, birthdays, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, and Christmas. ‼️【TIP】It is normal for the iron pan to rust and does not affect its use. Maintained according to the instructions and durable for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xr-PizzEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imarku","source_asin":"B09WYFXJD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYFXJD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYFXJD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
