window.products.push({"id":526529,"name":"Kitory Cleaver Butcher Knife 8\" Handmade Art Cleaver Knife LongQuan Forged Chinese Traditional Kitchen Chef`s Knife Hammered Finish HC Stainless Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816i9K+BGdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our cleaver butcher knife is a sharp and solid Chinese chef knife designed to cut boneless meats and poultry as well as slicing, dicing, mincing and chopping tough vegetables and fruits,but not for bone.  Full Tang forged high carbon steel by workers is great corrosion resistance, wear resistance, high hardness, and tensile strength, which is more solider than general butcher knife. Peak performance definitely exceeds your expectations. This kitchen cleaver knife is not only a knife, it is an ART work. Bolsters is made of pure copper and carved by hand. The pattern is the traditional auspicious dragon pattern, which is exquisitely carved with smooth lines.The dragon is a totem of China, symbolizing bravery and power. From every aspects, it is ART. Good for collection.  Ergonomic wenge wood handle provides extremely comfort and nice control, which ensures maximum performance while preparing your meals. Our cleaver knife make you enjoy cooking. Cleans easily.Small Tips for Using This Knife :  1. Due to this knife has higher carbon content, please pay attention to clean the knife, and acidic or alkaline substances cannot stay on the blade for a long period, it is not suitable for dishwasher. Such knife shall be washed by hand, then keep it air dry or wipe it by cloth. 2. Please store it in a safe place where your kids cannot get it. 3. Please do not touch the knife edge by hand directly. Specifications: Overall Length: 13\" Blade Length: 8\" Blade Thickness: 2 mm Blade Width: 3 1/4 \" Handle Length: 5\" Knife Weight: 430g 0.95lb Weight with Package: 688g 1.52lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816i9K+BGdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitory","source_asin":"B088F14SGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088F14SGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088F14SGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
