window.products.push({"id":526563,"name":"NeckBone Chiropractic Pillow by Original Bones, Grey Velour Fabric, Cervical Neck Pain Relief with Comfort Adjustment (Use at Home Bed, Office, Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QeUG+pfyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relax and realign anywhere. it is important to take some time from your busy schedule and pay attention to your body, mind and soul. The NeckBone is one of the most versatile support pillows available. Its \"bone\" shape and small size offers great support for the neck, lumbar region or between the knees during rest whether you are home or travelling. More specifically, the cervical vertebra is made up of seven parts and it is designed to have a healthy degree of curvature. Should the curvature become lost, the body will not stack properly and negative issues will arise exponentially. By training the vertebrae C1 – C7 with a product that offers the proper support you may avoid unwanted stress and tension. Tried and true, the NeckBone remains a top choice among health care professionals including chiropractors and physical therapists.. This pillow is subject to the individual’s personal comfort needs. You may adjust the filling as needed. If you need a smaller pillow, check out our cotton variety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QeUG+pfyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Original Bones NeckBone","source_asin":"B0797NN8MP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0797NN8MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0797NN8MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":526564,"name":"Beautiful Black & Grey Indian Wildflower Ombre Star Boho Mandala Art Cotton 100% Handmade Crafted Vintage Mandala Bohemian Tapesty Wall Hanging Art De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613zRfgUVQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Every Bohomandala Tapestry is designed to create good vibes & positive energy. A Tapestry is a heavier, decorative textile created to be used as a wall hanging, or wherever your creative soul desires. Mandalas can help relieve Tension & Anxiety, & can also stimulate Creative Thinking. In many cultures, the mandala is often used as a symbol for meditation, protection, wholeness & healing. It can be seen as a cosmic diagram that reminds us of the world that extends both beyond & within our bodies & minds. In each dimension, this symbol appears in all aspects of life: the Celestial circles we call Earth, Sun and Moon, as well as our circles of friends, family & surroundings. Each color & symbol within the mandala is believed to represent all aspects of life. Here are a few basics listed below: The circle stands for wholeness, integrity & unity || Vertical Lines are the connection between worlds or Energy || Horizontal lines divides the earth & sky (maternal energy) || Square represents our existence in this material world || Cross equals Recognition || Dot everything is One || Circle divided into 12 parts means the cycle of nature and wholeness Red: (1st Chakra) Fire and Passion || Orange: (2nd Chakra) Energy and Heat || Yellow: (3rd Chakra) Power, Light, & Joy || Green: (4th Chakra) Peace and Nature || Blue: (5th Chakra) Protection and Tranquility || Violet: (6th Chakra) Spiritual Forces || White: (7th Chakra) Purity and Unity Because each tapestry is strictly made for decoration, they are not as soft as a blanket or quilt (although they do soften up over time).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613zRfgUVQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bohomandala","source_asin":"B01AT51RPM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AT51RPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AT51RPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
