window.products.push({"id":526909,"name":"Smokeless Indoor Grill, 1600W 6 in 1 Portable Family Size Electric BBQ Grill with Child Safety Lock, Eficentline Removable Nonstick Grill Plate,Skewer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZgHxbpaL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"🍢[Infrared Heat Smokeless Technology Reduces Smoke]:Thanks to the smokeless heat technology, the infrared heat is only directed at the grill rack's surface and the cooling tray catches grease and oils before they get the chance to become smoke. It’s amazing technology that allows you to BBQ inside without all the worry of smoke and splattering everywhere! 🍗[6 Cooking Programs&Large Food-Grade SUS304 Grill Surface]:The electric grill has large cooking plate for 14 chicken wings! Easily prepare meals for up to 5-8 people with the 125 square-inch grilling surface. Perfect for a weekend BBQ or even a quick weeknight meal .Whether it’s hotdogs, burgers, steaks, chicken wings, vegetables, or whatever else !The food-grade SUS304 plus Teflon grill surface is super strong and won’t scratch! 🍗[Removable Nonstick Grill Plate&Skewer&Rotisserie Forks]:All-in-one:Grill,Rotisserie,and Skewer. Equipped with all the necessary grid, fork, skewer, the Barbechef lets you do everything! You can cook vegetable skewers, whole chickens and more!Use the Barbechef for more than just steaks and burgers!Constant infrared heat gives you evenly grilled,restaurant Quality BBQ!It means your food will retain up to 35% of its moisture! 🍢[LED Precision Temp.&Time Control]:Fitted with a touch-sensitive,precise controls your heatheat level up to 464°F, the advanced infrared heat technology, together with the special reflectors guide the evenly heat towards the grid to achieve perfect food maturity. Charcoal-grilled tender steak can lock the gravy under high electric heating, to obtain a better taste.Please note that every time you click the '﹥' on the control panel, the temperature will increase by 5°F until reaching 464°F. 🍢[Detachable Design&Easy to Clean$Warranty Service]:The indoor grill adopts a detachable design, all the accessories are easy to assemble, the accessories that can be used for dishwasher cleaning include grid,fork,skewer,bottom grid,drip tray,drip Tray Clamp. Whether hand wash or dishwasher, it can absolutely save your cleaning time.[Notice]:If you have any problem,please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZgHxbpaL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eficentline","source_asin":"B09VGZP7F8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-526909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VGZP7F8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VGZP7F8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
